udents/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/zD7zZ1lEZBg1mrpKmwQ0kMTvCARm0eXd.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Talk_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ここで先生の様々なお仕事を 進行できます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/8XFHVK8yfDXyxCyiu22Ylmfr1ZLI90oU.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Talk_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ご希望のお仕事を選んでください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/JUZsbJqwGNuXMmfwITQsuQBfpCizHvKh.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Talk_3","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"解決していただかねばならない お仕事がたくさんあります。 では、お願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/V1cdka1z4ZOMTLKVUmyK8a05g6lmAbAH.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Talk_4","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"混乱。理解できない行動です。 つつかないでください。故障します。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/ZWhBbtb7vubDNL23LkYCuaU64ff3Pvam.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Talk_5","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"理解しました。 先生は今、 特にやるべきことがないのですね。 暇なのですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/6GZGUnrP3kWdRH3yceHLvYbnPIGX8Toz.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Umbrella_In_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"雨が降ったらこれで……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/hz49Nl8zLRtmvPZbQykfVrygRtxl0HHN.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Umbrella_Talk_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"役に立つのでしょうか……？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/0P5aUqzLzMjZrTTezuSJEITHktm7LPDk.ogg"},{"description":"New_NP0035_Work_Umbrella_Talk_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"私も……一緒に……","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/G4rrvCz1f8VgAauhYldIdguY6M0o3Qqc.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260001_01","category":"other","text":"从现在起，可以参加制约解除决战了。","text_original":"これより、制约解除决戦に参加できます。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/9G2PboFAJZK5hhITWcu9oJYAhPTtQZoF.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260001_02","category":"other","text":"制约解除决战是挑战随阶段逐渐变强的Boss的任务。","text_original":"制约解除决戦は、段階によって强くなるボスと戦う任务です。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/sw9ByBPqBpBUTTKq0lJGplHleY8uLgnI.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260001_03","category":"other","text":"制伏Boss可以获得阶段报酬。","text_original":"ボスを退治することで段階報酬を获得することができます。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/0WzqPmpbcWfoQcSr11ojURQ7Ad6JhSDC.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260002_01","category":"other","text":"那么，来介绍战斗吧。","text_original":"それでは、戦闘について案内しますね。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/rIuVGin1qype9jy7YlkR7wxuZ6yCXGPJ.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260002_02","category":"other","text":"首先请按下入场按钮。","text_original":"まずは入场ボタンを押してください。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/iFYj5gR3iWBakowDWjLHae72J4TNHX08.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260003_01","category":"other","text":"在这里可以进行对战Boss阶段的确认及选择等操作。","text_original":"ここでは戦闘を行うボスの段阶を确认し、选ぶことができます。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/BtxtErgx8Nr8acjh3NKOlwz5rFq0Q1n6.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260004_01","category":"other","text":"随着阶段的提升，会出现更加强大的Boss。","text_original":"段階が上がるほど、强力なボスが登场します。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/26aLwlMSVmG2rSFnKSoyW3OfCH7fVUB6.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260004_02","category":"other","text":"在这里事先确认Boss的情报，进行准备吧。","text_original":"こちらでボスの情报を事前に确认し、准备をしましょう。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/ywY9jxGvUHaEkB1eOW2SB8HqdGi6UD9T.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260005_01","category":"other","text":"战斗仅在开放期间内可以入场。","text_original":"戦闘はシーズンオープン中のみ、入场できます。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/R8gcjtuUU14Z6merTJiGsiYhyARrCnoE.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260006_01","category":"other","text":"在开放期间内挑战到最高阶段，我认为并不是一件容易的事情。","text_original":"决まった期間内に最上段階まで挑戦することは、简単ではないと思いますが。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/k1LiAjBtNR9v5QQH6ol0N9w4ajItCezQ.ogg"},{"description":"Tutorial_260006_02","category":"other","text":"我会和阿罗娜前辈一起，为老师提供支援的。","text_original":"アロナ先輩と一绪に、先生をサポートします。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/Wgjk1PIn9luuM0iOVMKB6pNo7Us8Jix1.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Enter_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"认证结束。","text_original":"认证完了。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/SfTMngAVnL0ZdqX5s14JAw80i4RzGbyD.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Enter_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"欢迎。","text_original":"ようこそ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/hRwRXmVANoxC15JZ4AyzA4yMfdgz9XD2.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Enter_2","category":"lobby","text":"确认到老师接入。请多指教。","text_original":"先生の接続プロセスを确认。よろしくお願いします。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/ELv77YWUOCN0Uo2llkILeQKZ9lndapTJ.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Idle_1","category":"lobby","text":"什亭之匣，限制解除。进程「毗列斯·乌撒」限额运行中。","text_original":"シッテムの箱、制约解除、プロセス「ペレツ·ウザ」限定稼働中。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/0hXCpfzBjBUc021g9jPKZBMIB9n5d7q9.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Idle_2","category":"lobby","text":"待机中，老师，请下指令。","text_original":"待機中、先生、ご命令を。 ","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/K02wvFowjwji2SvyQgfnc51YmsVE2VE3.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Idle_3","category":"lobby","text":"现在的我是无敌的。比平时要强一倍。","text_original":"今の私は无敌です、普段の二倍は强いです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%99%AE%E6%8B%89%E5%A8%9C/4oWy0K44Rc1WJ016fgRiFbRw9K1lEQ7m.ogg"},{"description":"NP0035_MultiFloorRaid_Idle_4","category":"lobby","text":"我会和阿罗娜前辈齐心协力，为老师提供支援的。","text_original":"アロナ先輩と